    {
      "@id": "ucm:TrustFramework",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "rdfs:comment": "A set of rules, under a governing body, for identity proofing, authentication, federation and certification that participants agree to rely on, such as NIST SP 800-63-4, a Kantara assurance program, or the TEFCA Individual Access Services rules.",
